		{"id":"e4ce0f2c27c7ebf7","type":"text","text":"[skills]\n\n\n- Grasp key accounting principles and the bookkeeping process.\n- Understand the roles and duties of a bookkeeper.\n- Distinguish between different accounting methodologies.\n- Master initial setup and navigation of QuickBooks.\n- Execute fundamental transactions and operations in QuickBooks.\n- Establish company files including accounts, customers, and vendors in QuickBooks.\n- Efficiently manage receivables and payables in QuickBooks.\n- Conduct accurate and timely bank reconciliations in QuickBooks.\n- Process payroll transactions and generate reports in QuickBooks.\n- Apply complex bookkeeping tasks and adjustments in QuickBooks.\n- Create and customize comprehensive financial reports in QuickBooks.\n- Integrate QuickBooks with external applications.\n- Operate Excel for basic accounting tasks.\n- Develop and organize accounting spreadsheets in Excel.\n- Utilize essential formulas and functions for data analysis in Excel.\n- Leverage advanced Excel features for financial analysis.\n- Construct complex accounting models and simulations in Excel.\n- Automate reporting and create interactive dashboards in Excel.\n- Understand Financial Statements.\n- Perform Auditing.\n- Manage Billing.\n- Execute Data Entry.\n- Undertake Reconciliation.\n- General Accounting.\n- Handle Accounts Payable.\n- Conduct Invoicing.\n- Manage Accounts Receivable.\n- General Bookkeeping.\n- Financial Management.\n- Use Accounting Software.\n- Manage General Ledger.\n- Apply Generally Accepted Accounting Principles (GAAP).\n- Conduct Account Reconciliation.\n- Manage Ledgers in Accounting.\n- Perform Bank Reconciliations.\n- Process Payroll.\n- Handle Cash Receipts.\n- Work with Accruals.\n- Handle Sales Tax.\n- Perform Invoice Matching.","x":895,"y":-823,"width":810,"height":1783},
		{"id":"6b08fd22e19786b1","type":"text","text":"{{[[Course Builder V1/Project Creator]]}} create a project for {{outline}}","x":-3920,"y":4363,"width":250,"height":197,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"e206a944b2d106de","type":"text","text":"## Module 1: Fundamentals of Accounting and Bookkeeping\n\n### 1.1 Rationale for Learning Accounting and Bookkeeping Skills\n- **Importance of Financial Literacy**: Understand how knowledge of accounting and bookkeeping is crucial for making informed financial decisions in any business.\n- **Career Advancement**: Explore how these skills can open doors to opportunities in accounting, finance, and business management roles.\n- **Practical Application**: Discover the real-world use of accounting knowledge in everyday business operations and personal financial management.\n\n### 1.2 Learning Expectations for Module 1\n- **Key Principles Mastery**: Learners will be able to recount the significant accounting principles and describe the systematic bookkeeping process.\n- **Role Clarity**: Participants will recognize the roles and essential duties of a bookkeeper in various work environments.\n- **Methodology Differentiation**: Learners will distinguish between the cash and accrual accounting methodologies and identify appropriate contexts for each.\n\n### 1.3 Pre-Assessment: Assessing Your Accounting Basics\n- **Scenario-Based Questions**: Practical situational questions to measure understanding of when and why different accounting methodologies are used.\n- **Knowledge Check**: Multiple-choice questions to review basic accounting terms and the double-entry system.\n- **Skills Assessment**: Matching exercises to identify the correct roles and responsibilities of a bookkeeper.\n\n### 1.4 Understanding Accounting Concepts and Theories\n- **Accounting Equation**: Breakdown and illustration of Assets = Liabilities + Equity.\n- **Double-Entry System**: Clarification of the process and its role in maintaining balance in the books.\n- **Accounting Methodologies**: Explanation of cash vs. accrual accounting, including advantages and application scenarios.\n\n### 1.5 Step-by-Step Walkthrough of a Bookkeeping Cycle\n- **Transaction Recording**: Detailed guidance on documenting financial transactions accurately.\n- **Ledger Maintenance**: Step-by-step instructions on maintaining and balancing ledger accounts.\n- **Trial Balance Preparation**: Procedures for preparing a trial balance to check the integrity of the books.\n\n### 1.6 Best Practices in Accounting and Bookkeeping\n- **Documentation and Record Keeping**: Strategies for meticulous documentation and effective record management.\n- **Ethical Standards**: Outline of ethical considerations and compliance in accounting/bookkeeping.\n- **Continual Learning and Software Proficiency**: Importance of staying updated with accounting software and ongoing education in best practices.\n\n### 1.7 Case Study: Jane's Catering Service\n- **Business Overview**: Presentation of a hypothetical scenario centered around small business accounting and bookkeeping needs.\n- **Challenge Encounter**: Dive into common issues faced and decisions made regarding financial tracking and reporting.\n- **Resolution Steps**: Walk readers through the process of applying module knowledge to resolve the case study's accounting challenges.\n\n### 1.8 Application: Implementing Bookkeeping Basics\n- **Practice Activity - Transaction Recording**: Role-playing an entry of transactions into a mock bookkeeping system.\n- **Practice Activity - Financial Statement Preparation**: Compilation of basic financial statements given a set of financial data.\n- **Practice Activity - Method Selection**: Choose between cash or accrual basis for various business scenarios and justify the choice.","x":120,"y":1880,"width":1640,"height":1600,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"6d4cb37e40c281eb","type":"text","text":"[audience]\nAdult learners looking to upskill or for a career change or training in accounting basics","x":-340,"y":-194,"width":250,"height":220},
		{"id":"18795c84f0d61402","type":"text","text":"## 1.1 Rationale for Learning Accounting and Bookkeeping Skills\n\n### Importance of Financial Literacy\nWithout a solid grounding in accounting and bookkeeping, professionals across industries are at a disadvantage. The intricate dance of numbers defines business success—every debit has its credit; each financial decision, a ripple effect. Engaging with accounting and bookkeeping doesn't just equip you with the skills to decipher these numerical narratives; it empowers you to contribute to the story, shaping outcomes with precise, informed interventions. Imagine you are at a critical meeting with potential investors; armed with financial literacy, you can confidently analyze balance sheets, defend budget planning, and showcase the serenity of sound fiscal management. \n\n### Career Advancement\nAs you weave through the fabric of your professional growth, the ability to decode the language of accounting becomes an indispensable tool in your arsenal. For those pivoting into a new career path or elevating their current role, proficiency in this domain transforms you into an asset for any organization. You will not only interpret financial information but also forecast economic trends—skills that distinguish you as a forward-thinker and a catalyst for business resilience and innovation.\n\n### Practical Application \nThe pulsating heart of every business decision lies in its numbers. Mastering accounting and bookkeeping bestows you with the acumen to gauge the fiscal pulse of a company. Whether plotting the trajectory for an entrepreneurial venture or optimizing personal finances, these skills are the compass that guides you through the financial wilderness. Consider the potency of these competencies in everyday scenarios: discerning the viability of an investment opportunity, maximizing tax benefits, or steering a business toward sustainable growth—all hinge on the bedrock of accounting proficiency.\n\nIn this module, we shall transform theoretical constructs into tangible tools, facilitating immediate and impactful application in both your professional sphere and personal life. This isn't just about learning; it's about evolving into a strategic thinker with the agility to act on financial insights.","x":-2600,"y":1880,"width":888,"height":1147,"color":"6"},
